SwitchingFields -- Switch base fields and obtain natural maps for rings over finite fields
******************************************************************************************

Description
===========

SwitchingFields is a package that helps to switch the (finite) field of
coefficients of a given ring, to another given (finite) field via the natural
map between these fields.

Authors
=======

  * Zhan Jiang (see http://www-personal.umich.edu/~zoeng/ ) <zoeng@umich.edu>
  * Sarasij Maitra (see https://people.virginia.edu/~sm3vg )
    <sm3vg@virginia.edu>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.0 of SwitchingFields, released September
11th, 2020.

